comment0.text=\r\n Model a dock unit within a {@link BikeStation}.\r\n It tracks its charging capabilities, fee, and the electric bikes it has recharged.\r\n @author David J. Barnes and Michael K\u00F6lling\r\n @author DP classes \r\n @version 2026.10.13\r\n
